"P1624239055" "Gain the Support of the Skulls"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3622776316" "Come on man! Time is just going away here on this opportunity!"
// tokenprogressstring :
"P3807812470" "{Token} out of 5 Skulls rescued"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2953021339" "You rescued the Skulls and earned their backup for the robbery!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3774491787" "How'd things go on your end, {HeroName}? Wha? The office was empty? Man! That's too bad, but hey, on the bright side, you'll be in for a big surprise when you get into the vault!<br><br>I've got almost everything set up on my end. All that's left is making the big move on the the bank itself. You ready to make some <i>big</i> cash, {HeroName}?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - FireWire 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2925213514" "H-hey, just hold on, OK? I was just... just kiddin' around! H-hahaha! We're gonna beat Arachnos and take the loot for ourselves, right?<br><br>Okay... okay, I messed up. Okay! There, I said it! Just... come on {Hero.gender=male man|lady}, just let me go!<br><br>I'll leave you alone, you can get all the money, too!"
// Answer Text :
"P2651498126" "Not today, Fire Wire. (Kill Fire Wire)"
// Answer Text :
"P1666380731" "You're not worth killing, Fire Wire."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P2381953399" "<color orange>You kill Fire, ensuring he pays the ultimate price for trying to cross you!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1202243317" "Y-yeah?! You won't regret this, {HeroName}. I ain't gonna cross you again, I swear!<br><br>I ain't gonna forget this, promise!"
// Answer Text :
"P851974747" "You better not forget this, Fire Wire."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Harris 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2588912098" "{HeroName}, good to see you. My name is <color yellow>Bill Harris</color>. I am a lieutenant in <color yellow>Longbow</color>.<br><br>Don't be alarmed. I'm not here to bring you in. I'm here to ask for your help in bringing Longbow <i>down</i>.<br><br>I heard all about your escapades with Fire Wire and robbing the Mercy bank. I believe you and I, working together, could bring Longbow down."
// Answer Text :
"P330378681" "First a scumbag wants me to trust him, and now a Longbow says he's on my side? Go on."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P4219058705" "I'm out for <i>revenge</i>, {HeroName}, plain and simple.<br><br>I was wronged by a woman named <color yellow>Linda Page</color>, a fellow lieutenant. I was made a <i>fool</i>, {HeroName}, <i>mocked</i> by all in Longbow!<br><br>Everything I worked for was destroyed by that woman, and I intend to make her and <i>everyone</i> pay. I imagine that having Longbow out of the way will help <i>you</i> as well, so I propose that you and I work together. What do you say?"
// Answer Text :
"P776524055" "Alright, Harris, I'm in. You better not pull anything."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3376088908" "Okay, so here's the big plan, {HeroName}.<br><br>I'm gonna trigger the virus I put into their systems. It's gonna cause their turrets to <i>explode</i>. It's gonna cause a mess in the main lobby and take out the majority of the RIP guards.<br><br>That's when you make your way in to take out any of the remaining guards, and then break into the vault.<br><br>I'm gonna buy you some time by disconnecting their security systems, then I'll head over to the bank to give you some backup. You got any questions?"
// AcceptString :
"P375827448" "I'm assuming you'll help drag all of the loot out, right?"
// SendOffString :
"P1594464034" "Oh? Of course!<br><br>You and me, we're gonna get <i>everything</i> outta there together. If we go fast enough, we can get everything outta there before any extra security backup arrives.<br><br><i>Plus</i>, since the security cameras are gonna be disabled, they ain't gonna know it was us who robbed the place! Win win scenario, huh?"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3449064387" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: The Ballad of Fire Wire</color>"

